'''Radiant Faith''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Guardian]] that grants the '''Radiant Faith''' buff, which grants increased [[energy shield]] and additional [[armour]] relative to the amount of [[mana]] you've [[reservation|reserved]] to you and nearby [[Ally|allies]].

==Mechanics==
Because '''Radiant Faith''' is classified as an [[aura]] [[buff]] and not an aura [[active skill|skill]] / aura skill gem, mods such as {{c|mod|#% increased effect of Non-Curse Auras from your Skills}} does not increase the amount of [[Armour]] and [[Energy Shield]] granted from this ascendancy passive skill. However, those receiving the buff can increase the amounts received by their own {{c|mod|Increased Armour}} and {{c|mod|Increased Energy Shield}} stats. 

Note, that while the wording is similar to the Hierophant's [[Sanctuary of Thought]], the mechanics are quite different. Sanctuary of Thought functions as a conversion so {{c|mod|Increased Maximum Mana}} and {{c|mod|Increased Maximum Energy Shield}} mods stack with each other additively. '''Radiant Faith''' grants the percentage of your actual mana as base energy shield, so {{c|mod|Increased Maximum Mana}} and {{c|mod|Increased Maximum Energy Shield}} effectively stack multiplicatively with each other, which allows for extreme stacking of energy shield with proper gear.

